WEBVTT

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:26.580
Wow!

00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:29.190
The ground has...

00:00:29.290 --> 00:00:31.050
Collapsed!

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:32.320
We're...

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:36.790
Falling!

00:01:02.390 --> 00:01:08.190
The light of dawn pours over the vast Earth

00:01:02.390 --> 00:01:08.190
Daichi ni sosogu yoake

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:15.700
And marks the beginning of our journey

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:15.700
Tabidatsu toki wo tsugeru

00:01:17.670 --> 00:01:24.810
With our eyes on the future

00:01:17.670 --> 00:01:24.810
Mirai wo mezashi kaketeyuku kaze

00:01:25.280 --> 00:01:30.910
I deeply breathe in the rushing wind

00:01:25.280 --> 00:01:30.910
Kono mune ni suikonda

00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:40.550
The eyes that could only speak in dreams

00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:40.550
Yume dake wo kizamitsuketa hitomi

00:01:42.430 --> 00:01:48.060
Presented us with the path we're to take

00:01:42.430 --> 00:01:48.060
Bokura ni yuku michi wo ataeru

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:53.770
Fly to the Neverland

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:53.770
Fly to the Neverland

00:01:53.840 --> 00:02:03.270
Awaken the unlimited courage inside of us

00:01:53.840 --> 00:02:03.270
Kagiri nai yuuki wo mezamesasete

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:14.960
Ah, Chaos once again spreads out and extends.

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:20.870
Welcome to the night of Wonderland.

00:02:23.270 --> 00:02:26.800
I am Fabula, your guide.

00:02:28.310 --> 00:02:33.300
Our travelers arrive at an oasis in
the midst of the desert of flames.

00:02:33.950 --> 00:02:36.550
But this is Wonderland,

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:38.680
and that water burned brightly.

00:02:38.790 --> 00:02:40.810
Life was nearly extinguished.

00:02:42.060 --> 00:02:45.490
Please find what is important.

00:02:46.360 --> 00:02:50.560
It might be what is really close to you.

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:54.400
But now this evening once again,

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:58.400
they continue to run along the road
in this unnatural world.

00:03:08.780 --> 00:03:10.310
Ouch.

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:15.120
It looks like this soft sand really
saved us, acting like a cushion.

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:17.420
We probably would have died
if this wasn't Wonderland.

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:24.800
Kaze!

00:03:24.900 --> 00:03:27.230
Did you fall down here too, Mister?

00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:36.440
He said that the Subway is just
a little further down the way,

00:03:36.540 --> 00:03:38.440
and that it's about to depart!

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:41.250
I'm so exhausted!

00:03:41.680 --> 00:03:44.680
Let's just take a long break after
we get on the Subway.

00:03:47.920 --> 00:03:52.020
Kaze, let's go together, okay?

00:03:57.970 --> 00:04:01.130
<i>Everything will end with the next fight.</i>

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:03.900
<i>Everything...</i>

00:04:41.410 --> 00:04:43.740
There's another person riding the Subway.

00:04:44.110 --> 00:04:46.310
Maybe it's Mom or Dad.

00:04:46.410 --> 00:04:48.810
And maybe it's another one
of the Earl's henchmen!

00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:50.320
Let's go find out.

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:53.290
Ai! Yu!

00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:00.330
Hey, wait!

00:05:00.430 --> 00:05:02.120
We have something we want to ask you.

00:05:04.330 --> 00:05:06.530
Ai! Yu! Wait!

00:05:06.630 --> 00:05:08.360
That person's spirit is not human!

00:05:14.940 --> 00:05:17.340
It's a girl!

00:05:19.550 --> 00:05:22.810
A native of Wonderland?

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:28.080
Hello! We came here looking for our parents,

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:32.110
you haven't seen them, have you...

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:40.560
Lisa, it looks like a human.

00:05:42.240 --> 00:05:43.430
You're right.

00:05:58.990 --> 00:06:02.550
She's laughing. Who are you?

00:06:03.260 --> 00:06:06.450
Lou Lupus, but you can call me Lou.

00:06:06.560 --> 00:06:09.500
It's been so long since I've seen
someone else riding the Subway!

00:06:11.170 --> 00:06:13.730
You guys are pretty weird, aren't you?

00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:16.470
I've been back and forth all over Wonderland,

00:06:16.570 --> 00:06:20.170
but this is the first time I've heard of
people coming to Wonderland on purpose.

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:21.830
Why don't you join us, Lou?

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:24.430
It seems like you know of places
where there are more people.

00:06:24.550 --> 00:06:29.180
Yeah, it'd be great to have someone with us
who knows a lot about Wonderland.

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:30.340
Let's go!

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:34.520
Sounds good, but...

00:06:34.520 --> 00:06:38.010
You might not want me around once
you find out about my true self.

00:06:38.490 --> 00:06:39.550
Your true self?

00:06:40.030 --> 00:06:43.000
Oh, I doubt it could ever be worse
than Sis' true self.

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:45.760
What true self do you mean?!

00:06:46.770 --> 00:06:48.530
See what I'm talking about?

00:06:51.440 --> 00:06:56.240
By the way, is that guy a friend of yours?

00:06:57.180 --> 00:07:00.440
Well, I don't know that you'd say
he's a friend, but...

00:07:06.120 --> 00:07:09.090
Lou, do you ride the Subway often?

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:11.350
Not all the time.

00:07:11.460 --> 00:07:13.930
Do you ever see any other people
get on the train?

00:07:15.460 --> 00:07:17.160
Every once in a while.

00:07:17.270 --> 00:07:19.830
Maybe Mom and Dad are riding too.

00:07:19.930 --> 00:07:22.730
Yeah, we've never been up
to see the car in front.

00:07:22.840 --> 00:07:24.430
What if...

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:26.060
Let's go check it out.

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:27.270
Yeah.

00:07:34.020 --> 00:07:35.880
There's no one here, is there?

00:07:35.980 --> 00:07:37.880
There wasn't after all.

00:07:37.990 --> 00:07:40.550
We still haven't checked the car
in the very front.

00:07:40.660 --> 00:07:43.490
I think all that is up there
is the conductor's seat.

00:07:43.590 --> 00:07:45.860
Lou, have you ever seen the conductor?

00:07:45.960 --> 00:07:47.590
No, I haven't.

00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:48.960
Let's try going in.

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:55.290
There's no one here.

00:07:55.770 --> 00:07:57.170
Amazing, isn't it?

00:07:57.270 --> 00:08:01.710
It looks like a machine, but I can feel
the spirit of a living creature.

00:08:05.550 --> 00:08:08.110
Hey, look at that!

00:08:08.220 --> 00:08:11.670
<i>This is the culmination of all of my
sweat and skill, Catherine!</i>

00:08:12.750 --> 00:08:14.950
This is Cid's logo!

00:08:15.320 --> 00:08:18.380
So does that mean that Cid made the Subway?

00:08:18.490 --> 00:08:21.220
So he made more than the Wonderland Watch?

00:08:21.330 --> 00:08:24.260
Maybe that's why he wanted to see it so badly.

00:08:24.370 --> 00:08:26.130
But why didn't Cid...

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:29.670
This is way too suspicious, really!

00:08:32.410 --> 00:08:36.780
Well, if Cid really did make this,
he really is amazing.

00:08:38.880 --> 00:08:43.370
Something about all this gives Lou a bad feeling.

00:08:43.480 --> 00:08:44.820
Why is that?

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:50.520
What's that?!

00:09:03.970 --> 00:09:04.870
Is it an earthquake?

00:09:05.170 --> 00:09:07.540
I'm sensing an extraordinarily evil spirit.

00:09:09.080 --> 00:09:12.770
I know... Lou knows what it is...

00:10:10.770 --> 00:10:12.170
What's that?

00:10:12.610 --> 00:10:14.100
Omega...

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:15.180
Omega?

00:10:19.480 --> 00:10:22.180
It's going to break!

00:10:26.450 --> 00:10:29.080
What exactly is Omega?

00:10:29.190 --> 00:10:31.850
The phantom who will consume the world.

00:10:31.960 --> 00:10:34.690
He's the one who destroyed my world.

00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:37.560
He killed everyone whom I ever loved!

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:41.630
That part is nothing more
than Omega's claw.

00:10:41.740 --> 00:10:42.730
Claw?

00:10:42.840 --> 00:10:45.070
Omega's body was shattered into pieces,

00:10:45.070 --> 00:10:46.970
and those fragments were
scattered around Wonderland.

00:10:47.070 --> 00:10:49.870
But in spite of that, he still didn't die.

00:10:49.980 --> 00:10:52.340
Worlds will again be consumed.

00:10:52.450 --> 00:10:54.740
How can he still be alive if
he was broken to pieces?!

00:10:54.850 --> 00:10:57.720
I'm sorry, even I don't know that.

00:11:00.550 --> 00:11:03.150
It doesn't matter where, we've just
got to be sure to get out of here.

00:11:03.620 --> 00:11:06.720
He is something you simply
cannot run away from.

00:11:07.730 --> 00:11:11.460
Omega will not stop until he has
destroyed and consumed everything.

00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:21.170
Kaze!

00:11:24.680 --> 00:11:25.540
No way!

00:11:30.320 --> 00:11:31.940
What great power...

00:11:32.520 --> 00:11:35.280
It is confusing the spirits of this entire space.

00:11:35.620 --> 00:11:38.430
The energy is being disturbed by
the movements of that claw.

00:11:38.430 --> 00:11:40.520
It has the power to destroy without touching!

00:11:41.160 --> 00:11:43.860
If Omega walks, then the world will sink.

00:11:44.300 --> 00:11:47.430
If Omega flies, then the world will break.

00:11:47.540 --> 00:11:49.470
I don't want to say this...

00:11:49.570 --> 00:11:51.270
Don't talk like that, Sis.

00:11:51.370 --> 00:11:53.530
But this is the end for us!

00:11:53.640 --> 00:11:54.840
I told you to stop!

00:11:58.150 --> 00:12:00.340
Please, do something with your Magun.

00:12:12.630 --> 00:12:16.290
If he keeps going on like this,
everyone will die. Everyone!

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:22.870
<i>The world where I am from
had a beautiful ocean,</i>

00:12:22.870 --> 00:12:25.840
<i>a beautiful sky, and a beautiful forest.</i>

00:12:27.710 --> 00:12:31.870
<i>Everyone.... everyone... everyone...</i>

00:12:32.680 --> 00:12:33.650
<i>Everyone...</i>

00:12:39.190 --> 00:12:42.950
A mirror. I don't suppose any of you
have a mirror, do you?

00:12:43.360 --> 00:12:46.920
A mirror? Will that help you do anything?

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:50.390
I had one in my backpack, but Fungo ate it.

00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:53.170
That's right! Poshepocket!

00:12:55.700 --> 00:12:58.070
Give me a mirror, a mirror!

00:13:00.570 --> 00:13:03.540
How did something that big fit inside him?!

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:05.270
Thank you!

00:13:27.970 --> 00:13:28.960
Lou...

00:13:29.840 --> 00:13:31.960
Awesome!

00:13:32.070 --> 00:13:34.170
I knew she wasn't human.

00:13:36.240 --> 00:13:38.270
So is this what you meant by your true self?

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:40.480
You're so creepy cute!

00:13:41.680 --> 00:13:43.240
You guys are okay with this?

00:13:43.750 --> 00:13:46.050
We've seen so many surprises
since we came to Wonderland,

00:13:46.150 --> 00:13:47.620
I guess we're numb to it by now.

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:50.590
So is this why you thought we
wouldn't want you around?

00:13:50.690 --> 00:13:53.890
You shouldn't be embarrassed,
you should be proud of that!

00:13:53.990 --> 00:13:55.660
It's a really cool trick!

00:13:57.260 --> 00:13:58.660
Thank you.

00:13:59.270 --> 00:14:02.060
You guys hold on tight right there, okay?

00:14:02.170 --> 00:14:05.160
Lou, are you really going to fight him?

00:14:05.270 --> 00:14:08.670
I thought you said it was impossible
to run away from him.

00:14:08.780 --> 00:14:11.280
It may be impossible, but...

00:14:11.280 --> 00:14:13.970
I think I can hold him off long enough
for you to get away.

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:17.280
What are you going to do, Lou?!

00:14:19.820 --> 00:14:20.950
Lou!

00:14:30.060 --> 00:14:31.290
Lou!

00:14:43.710 --> 00:14:46.650
I've seen this light before.

00:14:49.650 --> 00:14:53.050
<i>Everything will end with the next fight.</i>

00:14:54.560 --> 00:14:55.820
<i>Everything...</i>

00:15:14.070 --> 00:15:15.060
Aura...

00:15:19.650 --> 00:15:21.140
It didn't work after all!

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:32.680
They didn't know me for very long,

00:15:32.790 --> 00:15:36.320
but they were still very kind to me.

00:15:37.260 --> 00:15:38.860
It's been fun.

00:15:40.230 --> 00:15:41.930
Thank you.

00:15:42.900 --> 00:15:44.730
Lou!

00:15:47.840 --> 00:15:51.210
Kaze, why didn't you help her?

00:15:51.680 --> 00:15:54.480
It's horrible of you to let her
fight all by herself!

00:15:54.580 --> 00:15:59.040
Even though she didn't look human,
she still always acted like one.

00:15:59.650 --> 00:16:02.620
How can you call yourself human
and do nothing?!

00:16:03.620 --> 00:16:07.250
Isn't your Magun supposed
to be used to help people?

00:16:14.370 --> 00:16:15.430
It has moved.

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:24.030
Soil is my power!

00:16:51.270 --> 00:16:54.260
The Magun has thawed!

00:17:00.710 --> 00:17:03.180
The appropriate Soil to use
against you has been decided!

00:17:07.320 --> 00:17:10.450
The red-hot fang, Cardinal Red!

00:17:18.430 --> 00:17:22.560
The deep red hurricane, Dark Crimson!

00:17:28.140 --> 00:17:32.940
And finally, the strength of steel,
Burnt Sienna!

00:17:42.720 --> 00:17:47.460
Scorch! I summon you, Ifrit!

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:29.200
His Summon is going to be killed!

00:18:40.850 --> 00:18:43.870
He can't be stopped even with
the power of the Magun?!

00:18:44.520 --> 00:18:46.250
No matter who I am up against,

00:18:46.350 --> 00:18:50.050
they will stop in the face
of Ifrit's raging flames.

00:19:23.590 --> 00:19:24.960
What about Omega?

00:19:25.390 --> 00:19:28.120
I can no longer sense his presence.

00:19:28.830 --> 00:19:29.820
Where's Kaze?

00:19:37.400 --> 00:19:39.300
Hey, check it out!

00:19:44.510 --> 00:19:45.980
Lou!

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:47.210
She's alive!

00:19:51.820 --> 00:19:52.810
Lou!

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:54.510
I'm so glad!

00:19:54.620 --> 00:19:57.560
I thought I was done for.

00:19:57.660 --> 00:20:01.390
I guess I've got a lot of good karma saved up.

00:20:02.130 --> 00:20:09.370
I'm sorry, Lou, I just froze up and let
you face the danger all by yourself.

00:20:09.470 --> 00:20:11.230
It wasn't your fault.

00:20:11.340 --> 00:20:13.700
That's right, I saw him...

00:20:13.810 --> 00:20:18.770
That guy, that nice man saved us, didn't he?

00:20:18.880 --> 00:20:22.410
Mister... He fell off, maybe he's dead.

00:20:22.520 --> 00:20:24.040
I'm not sure about that.

00:20:24.150 --> 00:20:26.620
Just like always, I'm sure he'll
pop up somewhere.

00:20:26.720 --> 00:20:30.590
I think so too! I'm sure that he's still alive.

00:20:31.260 --> 00:20:33.250
It looks like this time Omega is gone too.

00:20:34.860 --> 00:20:35.950
No...

00:20:36.560 --> 00:20:39.660
It would take more than that to kill him.

00:20:42.100 --> 00:20:44.760
We haven't seen the last of Omega.

00:20:53.910 --> 00:20:55.650
I am so thirsty

00:20:53.910 --> 00:20:55.650
Nodo ga karakara desu

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:57.020
It's really getting bad

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:57.020
Taihen nan desu

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:59.140
It's burning up inside of me

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:59.140
Kono mune ookaji desu

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:02.490
My heart skipped a beat

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:02.490
Kimi wo hitome mita

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:05.390
When I laid eyes on you

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:05.390
Shunkan bibi tto kita

00:21:05.390 --> 00:21:07.060
It's just like torture

00:21:05.390 --> 00:21:07.060
Goumon no you desu

00:21:07.060 --> 00:21:08.500
I can't take it

00:21:07.060 --> 00:21:08.500
Taekirenai desu

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:10.520
Ever since I fell in love with you

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:10.520
Kimi ni koi shite kara

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:13.970
My heart skips a beat whenever

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:13.970
Itsumo kimi to nita

00:21:13.970 --> 00:21:16.490
I see a girl with hair like yours

00:21:13.970 --> 00:21:16.490
Kamigata ni ha to suru

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:20.570
Please, God

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:20.570
Douka kamisama

00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:24.880
Can you please give me wings?

00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:24.880
Kono boku ni tsubasa kudasai yo

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:28.420
From now on, my thoughts of you

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:28.420
Kore kare kimi dake wo motto tsuyoku

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:31.040
Will only shine and grow stronger

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:31.040
Omotchatte kirakira

00:21:31.250 --> 00:21:34.050
There's so much I want to tell you

00:21:31.250 --> 00:21:34.050
Tsutaetai koto ippai

00:21:34.050 --> 00:21:37.060
There's not enough time left in the world

00:21:34.050 --> 00:21:37.060
Jikan ga tarinai nai ai ai

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:39.890
You are now the only person

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:39.890
Boku no hitomi ni wa mou

00:21:39.890 --> 00:21:42.230
That my eyes can see

00:21:39.890 --> 00:21:42.230
Kimi shika utsuranai

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:44.930
Now I've got my hopes set high

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:44.930
Kitai wa kore kara

00:21:44.930 --> 00:21:48.140
All of these thoughts are too much for me

00:21:44.930 --> 00:21:48.140
Nani kara nani made omoikitchatte

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:51.070
So I'm just going to spill my guts

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:51.070
Sa subete wo butsukeyou

00:21:51.170 --> 00:21:57.040
Nobody knows the right answer

00:21:51.170 --> 00:21:57.040
Seikai wa dare ni mo wakanai ai ai ai ai

00:21:57.040 --> 00:21:59.850
I'm already celebrating my joy

00:21:57.040 --> 00:21:59.850
Atama no naka de wa mou

00:21:59.850 --> 00:22:02.220
On the inside

00:21:59.850 --> 00:22:02.220
Shukufuku no kurakkaa

00:22:02.220 --> 00:22:05.190
Something is going to start

00:22:02.220 --> 00:22:05.190
Nani ka ga hajimaru

00:22:05.190 --> 00:22:07.920
Now I've got my hopes set high

00:22:05.190 --> 00:22:07.920
Kitai wa kore kara

00:22:07.920 --> 00:22:12.030
Let's never lose sight of our dreams

00:22:07.920 --> 00:22:12.030
Nozomi wo mochimashou

00:22:12.030 --> 00:22:13.390
All right!

00:22:12.030 --> 00:22:13.390
All right!

00:22:16.560 --> 00:22:19.590
Final Fantasy: Unlimited

00:22:23.600 --> 00:22:24.930
Here is my prophecy.

00:22:25.870 --> 00:22:28.710
Amidst richly colored sands...

00:22:28.710 --> 00:22:31.110
The strongest man of the Four Lords.

00:22:31.110 --> 00:22:33.240
He gets closer by the moment.

00:22:33.850 --> 00:22:36.180
Will it spell the end for the Black Wind?

00:22:41.120 --> 00:22:44.020
Next time, I will return to offer you
my Unlimited guidance.
